window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The next Otherworld anthology from number-one <i>New York Times</i> best-selling author Kelley Armstrong. </p> <p>More than a decade after Kelley Armstrong first opened the doors to the Otherworld, fans are still clamoring for more. In response to their demands - and to coincide with the Syfy Network show based on the series - Plume has signed up three Otherworld anthologies, each of which revolves around a different theme. The second in the trilogy, <i>Otherworld Secrets</i>, features fan favorites such as Cassandra, Savannah, and Adam in rare and never-before-published short stories - plus a brand new novella. Fans old and new will flock to this mystery-themed volume to discover the deepest secrets of this captivating world. </p>"; 
